        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2018-12-04/pdf/2018-26552.pdf"
      },
      "text": "(ii) the functions of the Director of the Office of Management and Budget \nrelating to budgetary, administrative, or legislative proposals. \nVerDate Sep<11>2014 19:42 Dec 03, 2018 Jkt 247001 PO 00000 Frm 00001 Fmt 4790 Sfmt 4790 E:\\FR\\FM\\04DEE0.SGM 04DEE0\n=== PDF page 2 of 2 ===\n62688 Federal Register / Vol. 83, No. 233 / Tuesday, December 4, 2018 / Presidential Documents"
    },
